=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">According to legend, finding the correct path about ten times may allow you to escape the cursed place. Of course, this may vary depending on the type of curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains visual depictions of severed body parts and human remains, scenes that may trigger photosensitive seizures, depictions of spiders, and sudden horror elements. Viewer discretion is advised.</p>","developers":["ChockTree"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354040/644cc83f20097e9409e5751a0bdfa97338c53682/header.jpg?t=1745398377","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095623,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095623/movie480.mp4?t=1738931348","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095623/movie_max.mp4?t=1738931348"},"name":"Milestone","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095623/8e217fbc443ddbd0abc72374d046ad7917feaa77/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738931348","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095623/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738931348","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095623/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738931348"}}],"nam